  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759220,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1001 Spikes - Nintendo 3DS Description\n\nEmbark on a perilous journey in *1001 Spikes*, a challenging platformer for Nintendo 3DS! As Aban Hawkins, son of a famed archaeologist, you must navigate the treacherous Ukampa Ruins in South America, dodging deadly traps and uncovering the mystery behind your father’s disappearance. \n\nThis throwback to classic 8-bit platformers demands precision, memorization, and flawless timing. Start with 1,001 lives, but be prepared to lose them all as you face a gauntlet of sharp spikes, poison darts, falling blocks, and flamethrowers, all while striving to reach the Door of Poko-Mum. \n\nDeveloped by 8bits Fanatics and Nicalis, *1001 Spikes* features single-player and multiplayer modes, a vast and increasingly difficult terrain, and exhilarating disasters.  Experience a demanding yet immensely satisfying gameplay loop, packed with unlockable characters and a multitude of levels. Can you conquer the ruins and discover the truth?"
    },
